# Development-only files are excluded from published archives.
#
# WHY: composer installs plugins from the GitHub codeload archive, and the
# consumer-facing payload of this package is src/ + plugin.json + composer
# metadata only. Shipping tests/, the QA scripts and the tool configs costs
# bytes and advertises internals to every install. The estate's Windows-side
# CRLF lesson (phlix-windows-client PR #46) shows .gitattributes coverage
# matters anyway — deliberately NO line-ending rules here: every tracked
# blob in this repo is already LF, and adding eol normalization without a
# need re-opens the byte-hash churn class for pinned archives (M-MUSICBRAINZ-28).
/.github/ export-ignore
/tests/ export-ignore
/scripts/ export-ignore
/phpunit.xml export-ignore
/phpstan.neon export-ignore
/phpstan.baseline.neon export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
